{"id":"n28049-1-10","stage":5,"title":"가급적 · 尽可能地","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28049-1-10-1","ko":"요즘 바빠서 고향에 계신 부모님께 전화도 못 드렸어.","zh":"最近太忙了，都没时间给在老家的父母打电话呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"바빠서","meaning":"忙，忙碌，紧张","explanation":"바쁘다：忙，忙碌，紧张；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"바쁘다","audio":"/audio/23457023f6034aaf6759.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66248","senseId":"1","lemma":"바쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바빠서","audio":"/audio/f983361aa92644829534.mp3"}},{"text":"고향에","meaning":"故乡，家乡","explanation":"고향：故乡，家乡；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"고향","audio":"/audio/998538467e18fc3a541b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27364","senseId":"1","lemma":"고향","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고향에","audio":"/audio/a09c591b445023ab68e7.mp3"}},{"text":"계신","meaning":"(尊称)身份高的人或长辈正在某个地方。","explanation":"계시다：(尊称)身份高的人或长辈正在某个地方；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"계시다","audio":"/audio/e0bef9809d26f11e8638.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17749","senseId":"2","lemma":"계시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계신","audio":"/audio/4ab47670c47861ce977a.mp3"}},{"text":"부모님께","meaning":"父母","explanation":"부모님：父母；께：에게 的敬语形式，表示“给、向、对”某位受尊敬的人。","readings":[{"term":"부모님","audio":"/audio/068bccdcf866defe1ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62272","senseId":"1","lemma":"부모님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부모님께","audio":"/audio/465c92fdbfbdfbc191ef.mp3"}},{"text":"전화도","meaning":"电话","explanation":"전화：电话；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"전화","audio":"/audio/6db518d738ede9912d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20260","senseId":"2","lemma":"전화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전화도","audio":"/audio/25d18ac921bb37cf66bf.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"드렸어.","meaning":"给、奉上（谦敬表达）","explanation":"드리다：给、奉上（谦敬表达）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드렸어","audio":"/audio/3004f2c73776491f9e21.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"23457023f6034aaf","term":"바쁘다","zh":"忙，忙碌，紧张","audio":"/audio/23457023f6034aaf6759.mp3","entryId":"66248","definition":"因为要做的事情多或没有时间而无暇顾及其他。","pronunciation":["바쁘다"]},{"id":"998538467e18fc3a","term":"고향","zh":"故乡，家乡","audio":"/audio/998538467e18fc3a541b.mp3","entryId":"27364","definition":"出生成长的地方。","pronunciation":["고향"]},{"id":"e0bef9809d26f11e","term":"계시다","zh":"(尊称)身份高的人或长辈正在某个地方。","audio":"/audio/e0bef9809d26f11e8638.mp3","entryId":"17749","definition":"(尊称)身份高的人或长辈正在某个地方。","pronunciation":["계ː시다","게ː시다"]},{"id":"068bccdcf866defe","term":"부모님","zh":"父母","audio":"/audio/068bccdcf866defe1ca7.mp3","entryId":"62272","definition":"(敬语)父亲和母亲。","pronunciation":["부모님"]},{"id":"6db518d738ede991","term":"전화","zh":"电话","audio":"/audio/6db518d738ede9912d10.mp3","entryId":"20260","definition":"人们通过电话机交谈；或指通过那样传达的内容。","pronunciation":["전ː화"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"给、奉上（谦敬表达）","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"61168","definition":"(尊称)给。","pronunciation":["드리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/591aba1172ee51437401.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28049-1-10-2","ko":"네가 잘 지내나 궁금하시겠다. 가급적 연락은 자주 드려.","zh":"父母一定很担心你过得好不好吧。尽量多跟他们联系哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"지내나","meaning":"度日，生活","explanation":"지내다：度日，生活；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"지내다","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17173","senseId":"1","lemma":"지내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지내나","audio":"/audio/1fb5e8e8d39e9afae154.mp3"}},{"text":"궁금하시겠다.","meaning":"好奇，挂念","explanation":"궁금하다：好奇，挂念；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"궁금하다","audio":"/audio/8aa230c6a19b7e60293f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"35136","senseId":"2","lemma":"궁금하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"궁금하시겠다","audio":"/audio/2fac41179cdf8a6180b6.mp3"}},{"text":"가급적","meaning":"尽可能地","explanation":"가급적：尽可能地。","readings":[{"term":"가급적","audio":"/audio/0fa1a38f4b3eafda4f59.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28049","senseId":"1","lemma":"가급적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가급적","audio":"/audio/0fa1a38f4b3eafda4f59.mp3"}},{"text":"연락은","meaning":"联络，联系","explanation":"연락：联络，联系；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"연락","audio":"/audio/b1c3b94a6a87c1f5d675.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14013","senseId":"1","lemma":"연락","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연락은","audio":"/audio/a726561d86b1c6504b56.mp3"}},{"text":"자주","meaning":"常常，经常","explanation":"자주：常常，经常。","readings":[{"term":"자주","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71199","senseId":"1","lemma":"자주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자주","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3"}},{"text":"드려.","meaning":"给、奉上（谦敬表达）","explanation":"드리다：给、奉上（谦敬表达）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드려","audio":"/audio/d67482a89ca79751977f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"d56e2e0e23cd1763","term":"지내다","zh":"度日，生活","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3","entryId":"17173","definition":"以某种程度或状态过日子。","pronunciation":["지ː내다"]},{"id":"8aa230c6a19b7e60","term":"궁금하다","zh":"好奇，挂念","audio":"/audio/8aa230c6a19b7e60293f.mp3","entryId":"35136","definition":"因担心什么，心里十分焦急。","pronunciation":["궁금하다"]},{"id":"0fa1a38f4b3eafda","term":"가급적","zh":"尽可能地","audio":"/audio/0fa1a38f4b3eafda4f59.mp3","entryId":"28049","definition":"可以或可能地。","pronunciation":["가ː급쩍"]},{"id":"b1c3b94a6a87c1f5","term":"연락","zh":"联络，联系","audio":"/audio/b1c3b94a6a87c1f5d675.mp3","entryId":"14013","definition":"传达告知某个事实。","pronunciation":["열락"]},{"id":"604b383d216f9452","term":"자주","zh":"常常，经常","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3","entryId":"71199","definition":"重复做同样事情的间隔短暂地。","pronunciation":["자주"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"给、奉上（谦敬表达）","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"61168","definition":"(尊称)给。","pronunciation":["드리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/75df22abc1242f0106d6.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.28,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=28049","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":156,"sequenceScore":3.1067,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["父母一定很担心你过得好不好吧。尽量多跟他们联系哦。","听说你得了食物中毒？身体怎么样了？","最近太忙了，都没时间给在老家的父母打电话呢。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["父母一定很担心你过得好不好吧。尽量多跟他们联系哦。","最近太忙了，都没时间给在老家的父母打电话呢。","听说你得了食物中毒？身体怎么样了？"],"answer":0}]}
